{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25455","headline":"峡山亭月夜独宿对樱桃花有怀伊川别墅 · 李德裕","name":"峡山亭月夜独宿对樱桃花有怀伊川别墅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皎月照芳树，鲜葩含素辉。\n愁人惜春夜，达曙想岩扉。\n风静阴满砌，露浓香入衣。\n恨无金谷妓，爲我奏思归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25455.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25455","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}